{"id":"60d18ddce61a8115","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization.md","title":"Oracle Characterization of the Polynomial Hierarchy","display":"thm-ph-oracle-characterization — Oracle Characterization of the Polynomial Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization","aliases":["28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization"],"display":"thm-ph-oracle-characterization — Oracle Characterization of the Polynomial Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-qbf-k]]","[[28-df-oracle-class]]","[[28-thm-qbf-k-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ph-oracle-characterization — Oracle Characterization of the Polynomial Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91bfe52ee99ebd32\" href=\"?note=91bfe52ee99ebd32\" title=\"28-df-qbf-k\">28-df-qbf-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" href=\"?note=f4ae5e0b4d42d561\" title=\"28-df-oracle-class\">28-df-oracle-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df4da83945861d78\" href=\"?note=df4da83945861d78\" title=\"28-thm-qbf-k-complete\">28-thm-qbf-k-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}\">\\(\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}^B\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}^B\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}}\n=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}}\n=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书详细展示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=2\">\\(k=2\\)</span>：第一个存在块由非确定机猜测，剩余全称判断由 SAT 预言机取反回答。反向把整条接受分支、全部预言机回答及肯定回答的证据同时存在猜测，再用一个全称块验证所有否定回答；计算本身是确定型多项式验证。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 重复同样的量词与预言机对应。类指数用全部固定预言机语言的并定义；由 QSAT 完全性得到与固定完全语言相同的类。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理5.12及证明；印刷102–103页；PDF128–129页。一般陈述和第二层证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-qbf-k","status":"resolved","id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-qbf-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-oracle-class","status":"resolved","id":"f4ae5e0b4d42d561","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-oracle-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-qbf-k-complete","status":"resolved","id":"df4da83945861d78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-qbf-k-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\mathrm{QSAT}_{k-1}}\n=\\mathbf{NP}^{\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}}.","display":true},{"tex":"k=2","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约、搜索与层级扩充：[[28-thm-np-hardness-consequences]]、[[28-thm-exp-nexp-padding]]、[[28-thm-np-search-to-decision]]、[[28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["e4f9f10bc85fd486","91bfe52ee99ebd32","f4ae5e0b4d42d561","df4da83945861d78"]}